items.translit:
La ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lah;

Lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu;

Wahuwa ‘ala kulli shay’in qadeer;

Allahumma la mani‘a lima a‘tayt;

Wala mu‘tiya lima mana‘t;

Wala yanfa‘u dhal-jaddi minka al-jaddu.

La ilaha illallahu, wahdahu la sharika lah;

Lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu;

Wahuwa ‘ala kulli shay’in qadeer;

La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah;

La ilaha illallahu, wa la na‘budu illa iyyah;

Lahun-ni‘matu wa lahul-fadlu wa lahuth-thana’ul-hasan;

La ilaha illallahu mukhlisina lahud-deena walaw karihal-kafirun.

La ilaha illallahu, wahdahu la sharika lah;

Lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu;

Wahuwa ‘ala kulli shay’in qadeer.

La ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lah;

Lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu;

Yuhyi wa yumit;

Wahuwa ‘ala kulli shay’in qadeer.

Allahumma inni as’aluka ‘ilman nafi‘a;

Wa rizqan tayyiba;

Wa ‘amalan mutaqabbala.

Bismillah, was-salatu was-salamu ‘ala rasulillah;

Allahumma inni as’aluka min fadlik;

Allahumma a‘simni min ash-shaytanir-rajim.
